<!-- WHY ORCHID -->
<section class="sec sec-cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div><span class="label" data-reveal>05 — Why Orchid</span><h2 class="h2" data-reveal>Why Families Choose<br><em class="serif-it gold">Orchid Builders</em></h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="feat-grid"><div class="feat" data-reveal data-delay="0.00">
  <span class="fn">01</span>
  <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 19l7-7-4-4-7 7v4h4zM15 6l4 4M4 20h16"/></svg></span>
  <h4>Custom Design Solutions</h4><p>Every project is designed from a blank page — your plot, your lifestyle, your budget. Nothing from a catalogue.</p>
</div><div class="feat" data-reveal data-delay="0.08">
  <span class="fn">02</span>
  <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.4"/><path d="M2.5 20c.8-3.6 3.4-5.4 6.5-5.4s5.7 1.8 6.5 5.4M16 4.6a3.4 3.4 0 010 6.8M17.5 14.8c2 .6 3.5 2.2 4 5.2"/></svg></span>
  <h4>Experienced Team</h4><p>Architects, structural engineers and site leads with 12+ years and 250+ delivered projects across Kerala.</p>
</div><div class="feat" data-reveal data-delay="0.16">
  <span class="fn">03</span>
  <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 2.5l8 3.5v6c0 5-3.4 8.3-8 9.5-4.6-1.2-8-4.5-8-9.5V6l8-3.5z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.4 2.4 4.6-4.8"/></svg></span>
  <h4>Quality Construction</h4><p>Branded materials, engineered supervision and stage-wise quality audits — documented and shared with you.</p>
</div><div class="feat" data-reveal data-delay="0.00">
  <span class="fn">04</span>
  <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 01-8 8c-1.4 0-2.8-.3-4-1l-5 1.3L5.3 16A8 8 0 1121 12z"/><path d="M8.5 11h7M8.5 14h4.5"/></svg></span>
  <h4>Transparent Communication</h4><p>Weekly photo reports, itemised bills and one project manager who always answers your call.</p>
</div><div class="feat" data-reveal data-delay="0.08">
  <span class="fn">05</span>
  <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="8"/><path d="M12 9v4l3 2M9 2.5h6"/></svg></span>
  <h4>Timely Delivery</h4><p>Master schedules with stage gates and penalty-backed timelines written into your agreement.</p>
</div><div class="feat" data-reveal data-delay="0.16">
  <span class="fn">06</span>
  <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 2.5l9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5zM3 12.5l9 5 9-5M3 17.5l9 5 9-5"/></svg></span>
  <h4>End-to-End Management</h4><p>Design, approvals, construction, interiors and landscaping — one accountable team from sketch to key.</p>
</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESS -->
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap proc-grid">
    <div class="proc-sticky">
      <span class="label" data-reveal>06 — Our Process</span>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin:24px 0" data-reveal>From First Sketch<br>To <em class="serif-it gold">Final Key</em></h2>
      <p class="lead" data-reveal>Eight clear stages. One accountable team. You always know what happens next, what it costs, and when it will be done.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:36px" data-reveal><a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-line-ink" data-testid="process-start-btn">Start With a Consultation <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
    </div>
    <ol class="process-list">
      <li class="process-line" aria-hidden="true"><span class="process-line-fill"></span></li>
      <li data-reveal data-delay="0.00">
  <span class="pno">01</span><h4>Consultation</h4><p>We listen first — family, lifestyle, plot and budget — before drawing a single line.</p>
</li><li data-reveal data-delay="0.06">
  <span class="pno">02</span><h4>Planning</h4><p>Site study, feasibility, vasthu preferences and a clear project roadmap.</p>
</li><li data-reveal data-delay="0.12">
  <span class="pno">03</span><h4>Design</h4><p>Concept to detailed architecture, refined with you room by room.</p>
</li><li data-reveal data-delay="0.18">
  <span class="pno">04</span><h4>Visualization</h4><p>Photorealistic 3D views so you approve your home before it exists.</p>
</li><li data-reveal data-delay="0.24">
  <span class="pno">05</span><h4>Cost Evaluation</h4><p>Itemised, quantity-based estimates with stage-wise cash flow.</p>
</li><li data-reveal data-delay="0.30">
  <span class="pno">06</span><h4>Construction</h4><p>Engineered execution with branded materials and weekly reporting.</p>
</li><li data-reveal data-delay="0.36">
  <span class="pno">07</span><h4>Quality Assurance</h4><p>Stage-wise audits, material tests and a documented snag process.</p>
</li><li data-reveal data-delay="0.42">
  <span class="pno">08</span><h4>Handover</h4><p>Final walkthrough, documentation, warranties — and your keys.</p>
</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

